NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE. This software produces trade setups whose measured
historical expectancy is, on the samples tested, statistically indistinguishable
from zero or negative net of costs. See README.md and src/tools/finance/
calibration.ts for the measurements. Nothing here is a recommendation to trade.
